## \`m3e-button\`

Material 3 button.

| Var | Type | Theme namespace | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`--m3e-button-container-color\` | \`color\` | \`--color-*\` | Container fill colour. |
| \`--m3e-button-container-color-on-scroll\` | \`color\` | \`--color-*\` | Container colour during scroll state. |
| \`--m3e-button-duration\` | \`time\` | \`--transition-duration-*\` | State-change duration. |
| \`--m3e-button-elevation\` | \`*\` | \`--shadow-*\` | Shadow elevation. |
| \`--m3e-button-label-text-color\` | \`color\` | \`--color-*\` | Label colour. |
| \`--m3e-button-shape\` | \`length\` | \`--radius-*\` | Corner radius. |

## \`m3e-icon\`

